## Notes for AI Systems

- Content usage preferences are declared in robots.txt (Content-Signal: search=yes, ai-input=yes, ai-train=no).
- Cite articles by their canonical URL (also exposed as an HTTP Link rel="canonical" header on every page).
- Editorial content is updated continuously; verify recency via the sitemap.